# Feature Request

Thank you for helping improve Mettelo.

We welcome ideas that make our projects, tools, documentation, and community more valuable for data and AI professionals.

Please complete the sections below before submitting your request.

---

# Feature Summary

Provide a short summary of your idea.

Example:

> Add an AI-powered project recommendation system.

---

# Problem Statement

What problem does this feature solve?

Describe the challenge or pain point you have experienced.

Examples:

- Manual process
- Missing functionality
- Poor user experience
- Difficult onboarding
- Repetitive work
- Performance limitations

---

# Proposed Solution

Describe your proposed solution in as much detail as possible.

Include:

- How it should work
- User experience
- Expected behaviour
- Technical considerations (if applicable)

---

# Benefits

How would this feature improve Mettelo?

Select all that apply.

- [ ] Better user experience
- [ ] Improved collaboration
- [ ] Increased productivity
- [ ] Better accessibility
- [ ] Improved documentation
- [ ] Better project management
- [ ] Better learning experience
- [ ] Better developer experience
- [ ] Other

Please explain.

---

# Possible Implementation

If you have ideas about implementation, describe them here.

Examples:

- Suggested architecture
- Technologies
- APIs
- Frameworks
- Design ideas

This section is optional.

---

# Alternatives Considered

Have you considered any alternative solutions?

If yes, explain why you prefer this proposal.

---

# Mock-ups or Examples

If applicable, attach:

- Screenshots
- Diagrams
- Wireframes
- Flowcharts
- Example implementations
- Links to similar features

---

# Repository

Which repository is this feature intended for?

- [ ] .github
- [ ] community
- [ ] labs
- [ ] roadmaps
- [ ] playbooks
- [ ] project-library
- [ ] datasets
- [ ] career-resources
- [ ] Other

Repository Name:

---

# Additional Context

Include anything else that would help us understand your proposal.

Examples:

- Related issues
- Research
- Community discussions
- User feedback
- Industry examples

---

# Checklist

Before submitting, please confirm:

- [ ] I searched existing Issues and Discussions.
- [ ] This feature aligns with Mettelo's mission.
- [ ] I have clearly explained the problem.
- [ ] I have described the proposed solution.
- [ ] I understand this request may require discussion before implementation.

---

# Contributor Interest

Would you like to help implement this feature?

- [ ] Yes, I'd like to contribute.
- [ ] Yes, but I need guidance.
- [ ] No, I'm only suggesting the idea.

---

Thank you for helping shape the future of Mettelo.

Every thoughtful idea helps us build a stronger ecosystem where data and AI professionals can learn, build, prove, and grow together.

